   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Visual guide to Stage 3 note 1: why a delivery is a chain of failing hand-offs, how the three guarantees differ,\nwhere duplicates and losses are born, and how EventPulse gets an exactly-once EFFECT with at-least-once delivery + an\nidempotent sink.",
