   "locked": false,
   "text": "Cheat sheet:   at-most-once = loss yes, dup no   |   at-least-once = loss no, dup yes   |   exactly-once = loss no, dup\nno (visible effect only)",
   "originalText": "Cheat sheet:   at-most-once = loss yes, dup no   |   at-least-once = loss no, dup yes   |   exactly-once = loss no, dup\nno (visible effect only)",
