   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "One-liner:  Delivery is at-most-once or at-least-once; \"exactly-once\" is at-least-once delivery plus a processing\nstep that makes duplicates harmless.",
   "originalText": "One-liner:  Delivery is at-most-once or at-least-once; \"exactly-once\" is at-least-once delivery plus a processing\nstep that makes duplicates harmless.",
